At **Red Agency**, our Account team had to ask the Digital team for manual Ads Manager screenshots to prepare detailed ad reports. Missing screenshots meant another request and more work. I built **Red Agency Ads**, now **Clario**, to make campaign data and reporting directly usable by the Account team.

Clario is now used **across the Account team for daily tracking and PDF reporting**. I estimate that preparing a detailed PDF takes about **five minutes**, compared with roughly **half a working day** for the former screenshot-based process. The PDF can go directly to a client's marketing specialist for review. Both timings are estimates from our working experience with detailed ad reports.

My part covers the marketing logic, product requirements, workflow, visual direction and AI-assisted development. The product is in internal use, with a public preview supporting my longer-term ambition to develop it further.
